{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "69c3a30a8a1ed27f8db7d1748ae76663cea0a35830edc8e42b2d6e83ee3e3698", "ja": "そして幕は上がりゆく", "zh": "然后帷幕渐起", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e6cf3fbd98ced567357e4d29d3a4e6dc4be889b6b281d2cd2f44e172a599869f", "ja": "本番直前、通し稽古をするメンバー。完璧な\n仕上がりにプロデューサーも納得。志保と話\nす歌織は、志保が答えを見付けてくれた事を\n喜ぶ。そして、今度は自分ともデートして\n欲しいと言い出すのだった。", "zh": "正式演出前，成员们进行完整排练。完美的\n完成度让制作人也感到满意。与志保交谈的歌织，\n为志保找到了答案而感到高兴。随后，她又说\n下次也想和自己约会。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1000_p", "source_sha256": "28e550189d13e87be32df24ab51c8cecfa9d0f719fd43fc22e5fca9d740ad3b1", "ja": "（ミュージカル公演の練習も、\nいよいよ大詰め。今日は通し稽古を行った）", "zh": "（音乐剧公演的练习也终于到了最后阶段。今天进行了完整排练）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1001_017kth", "source_sha256": "e5739bc62467eeb14bd35e61373a9505e6c2f3dcc5832ccb1f228ee854bb7937", "ja": "お疲れさまです、{$P$}！\nあの、どうでしたか……？", "zh": "辛苦了，{$P$}先生！  \n那个，感觉怎么样……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1002_021mat", "source_sha256": "080c817a3a6797bc68dcc8742efeb07b5e9f41105ef48f286be00b7bf2559fb3", "ja": "ぶらぼー！なのです。とってもステキだったのです～。\n{$P$}さんも、そう思いますよね？", "zh": "太棒了！真的特别精彩呢～  \n{$P$}先生也这么觉得吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4ae4ae36a082cdb029082a1e4083ba3c2088ced6d80aa44e72934d416f32d848", "ja": "まつり、琴葉もお疲れさま！\nうん。ふたりとも、完璧に仕上がってたよ。", "zh": "茉莉、琴叶也辛苦了！\n嗯。两个人状态都调整得非常完美哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1004_p", "source_sha256": "cc23640a5aae69cad272099b2b673f11cac87cd15440b54ffa1bd13660d84e76", "ja": "後は、本番当日を迎えるだけだ。\nふたりとも、しっかり体を休めてくれ！", "zh": "接下来只要迎接演出当天就行了。\n你们两个好好休息一下身体吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1005_017kth", "source_sha256": "4318af2cef2b65e1a4e272d6ffb675b6d7916b751015a2b3f9259ee832fb2b26", "ja": "はいっ！（なのです♪）", "zh": "是！（没问题♪）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1006_021mat", "source_sha256": "1ed69e2310d4a1282d340f71ef135b193fadf63f6135025b718408b03295aa8a", "ja": "はいなのです♪", "zh": "是的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1007_p", "source_sha256": "720f2928067ab1107f8dc8f6a66aed06c68135fd6b5de70e69da8054c96adafc", "ja": "（そして、歌織さんの出した宿題に、\n志保がどう答えるかが気になっていたが……）", "zh": "（然后，我一直很在意志保会如何回答歌织小姐布置的作业，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1008_p", "source_sha256": "be61a8f18edcf9f3d55ade0763130832b5cb04c6ab342db81b18b76f396c1cb3", "ja": "志保、お疲れさま！　前回より良くなったな。\n主人公の気持ちが、よく伝わってきたぞ。", "zh": "志保，辛苦了！比上次有进步呢。\n主人公的心情，很好地传达出来了哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499", "ja": "ありがとうございます。", "zh": "谢谢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1010_052kao", "source_sha256": "d37191bdfd595736b0c394265e21c84cae6313d543216c71cd8182074fa219fb", "ja": "本当、まさにミュージカル女優、って\n感じだったわ。お疲れさま、志保ちゃん！", "zh": "真的很有音乐剧女演员的感觉呢。辛苦了，志保！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1011_052kao", "source_sha256": "7b0a3ac96765ea10d6ba1d1464b903c8bf63dcebfbcacce19c0959bdbe87ee4b", "ja": "その様子だと、私が出した課題の答えも\nちゃんと見つけてくれたみたいね？", "zh": "看你的样子，似乎也已经找到了我布置的课题的答案呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1012_033sih", "source_sha256": "1ad645ebd351ca5e35553554efddb09ec7a9960f5d6d03931ebeface5c94da30", "ja": "ええ。自分なりに、答えは出したつもりです。", "zh": "是的。我也算是按照自己的方式，得出了答案。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1013_033sih", "source_sha256": "0fdec79f44a079e55154a88fe0ec446ca7735ad7b68b9c0f02cc84b10ffdc784", "ja": "ミュージカルの登場人物は、なぜ歌うのか。\nただのセリフじゃなく、歌に乗せる意味。それは……。", "zh": "音乐剧中的登场人物，为什么要歌唱呢。\n不只是单纯的台词，而是用歌声表达的意义。那就是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1014_033sih", "source_sha256": "dbbd976294e93fd0930b0cd465f40a9e5158293311e78b605d573db9acce5239", "ja": "伝えるため……じゃ、ないでしょうか。", "zh": "是为了传达……不是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1015_052kao", "source_sha256": "91e111bf1295ee015feebab60434d0114d71d72d6b361302de86769967230cec", "ja": "伝えるため……。", "zh": "为了传达……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "99bd8a407bc3206000b3c9fe8e75e693ace4221452f5912e9a3dcca12b4d71a8", "ja": "はい。言葉だけじゃ表現しきれない、\n大きすぎる想い……。", "zh": "是的。仅凭语言无法完全表达，那份过于强烈的心意……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1017_033sih", "source_sha256": "8ed7ad58a6162a68a6b4777132cdd8dc87319b0517faeaef79a9613a6b546033", "ja": "それを少しでも伝えたいから、歌も、踊りも、\nなにもかも使って、精いっぱい表現しようとしている。", "zh": "正因为想多少传达出一点这份心意，所以无论是歌、舞蹈，还是其他一切，我都想竭尽全力地表达出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1018_033sih", "source_sha256": "6e08ca5e34fcce018332bf9569fbf91c144aa4955c28ac62ebcb07a90169e514", "ja": "そういうことなんだと、私は思いました。\n……違いますか？", "zh": "我想，我明白了，就是这么回事。\n……不对吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1019_052kao", "source_sha256": "2b834582627c80d2e577465c1b33b275034f95862f812c2b2025329c0ecd5c6c", "ja": "ううん！　とっても素敵な答えだと思う。\n志保ちゃん、さすがね！", "zh": "不！我觉得这是个非常棒的答案。\n志保，你真厉害！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1020_033sih", "source_sha256": "7682d1f41380b18e72fc4b93d9d9f1e096891228286d842ca7fcf288c8277408", "ja": "あの、歌織さん。それで、正解は……。", "zh": "那个，歌织小姐。所以，正确答案是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1021_052kao", "source_sha256": "2bb55ef4f48f0103c12d537f99e955ff6d88b1c603d1d1f7dad1678b48558252", "ja": "正解は、別になかったの。志保ちゃんが\nいろいろ考えるきっかけになってくれれば、それで。", "zh": "其实，并没有什么所谓的正确答案。只要能成为志保思考各种事情的契机，就够了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1022_052kao", "source_sha256": "839dbc6fc18ae9a38727747146946eeaba2468039aa7e952eb1218ea2d527646", "ja": "強いて言うなら、自分で見つけたその答えが、\n志保ちゃんにとっての『正解』ってことね♪", "zh": "硬要说的话，自己找到的那个答案，对志保来说就是“正确答案”呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1023_033sih", "source_sha256": "6d37153b0d761d2837af71d2628bbe7b7d88bb972d266b4829b4eb62293a1ede", "ja": "はあ。……正直、そんな気はしていましたけど。", "zh": "唉……老实说，我也有这种感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1024_p", "source_sha256": "07d7427a862532821a316407dce706fdd30645f2725d94ceedbb23d93d395166", "ja": "ははは……まあ、良かったじゃないか。\n実際、こうして結果が出せたわけだからな。", "zh": "哈哈哈……不过，这不是挺好的吗。\n实际上，也确实取得了这样的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "7d541529167d94d0f2d7675a5793c57deae6318e54ce2f69f4dfa3dbbc7956f9", "ja": "そうですね。……歌織さんが教えてくれなければ、\n「なぜ歌うか」なんて考えなかったですし。", "zh": "是啊……如果不是歌织姐教我，我也不会去思考“为什么要唱歌”这种事。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1026_033sih", "source_sha256": "91cdd6220506bbfe9b5390855a2df90d27cf2c0390081147ed8b0c3f5e6446f1", "ja": "それに、答えを探して色々な人と話したことも、\n今回の舞台に役立ったと思います。", "zh": "而且，为了寻找答案，我也和各种各样的人聊过，这些经历对这次的舞台也很有帮助。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "a59f395539fd3f82fc01dd5cdd1c5b2a56f01047be94976da208d1837d9b3030", "ja": "ヒロイン役をやる上で、少し自信がついたというか……\nみんなが、私のことを、か……。", "zh": "在饰演女主角的过程中，感觉自己稍微有了点自信……大家觉得我……吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1028_p", "source_sha256": "dc32ae73024d3dd082a74a20976fa53fb0d643b1a092c2039a37688ffba2f786", "ja": "か？", "zh": "吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1029_033sih", "source_sha256": "c82c6d251b62e97389fa84c37bd949489ecf68303324dbdc347a022c007ee544", "ja": "……なんでもありません。", "zh": "……没什么。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1030_052kao", "source_sha256": "cd01a08bee1174f9ed587dec2b33f4c2156d460830b61868d4432e30dd0a2fa1", "ja": "ふふっ。……ところで、志保ちゃん。\n琴葉ちゃんやまつりちゃんだけじゃなくて……。", "zh": "呵呵。……话说回来，志保。\n听说你不只是和琴叶、茉莉……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1031_052kao", "source_sha256": "a9e4c82804ad99db7aa6a596852e1f29b036cb7e28ea67348da6a67b003941f8", "ja": "可奈ちゃんや{$P$}さんとも、\nデートしたって聞いたんだけど……本当？", "zh": "听说你还和可奈以及{$P$}先生约过会……是真的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1032_p", "source_sha256": "abb17a2e7faaa818f1b114bb851df1f16b213cfd61700ddeb10e10bb056c0011", "ja": "いや、あれはデートというか……。", "zh": "不，那个与其说是约会，其实是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1033_033sih", "source_sha256": "38e72f6fd77f03563f5d03330e0c4d0e8cb46787cea589be7068d4b9bd61d77d", "ja": "デートじゃありません。ふたりには、\n私の役作りに、つきあってもらっただけです。", "zh": "那不是约会。只是让她们陪我进行角色塑造而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1034_052kao", "source_sha256": "ee370cd87afb79cfeda2f8198b92edb01b7c368bb4584e7efe2f5cf8a7abe998", "ja": "だったらなおさら！　私とも、デートしてほしいな？\n私も、志保ちゃんに恋するひとりを演じるんですもの！", "zh": "那就更应该这样了！也希望你能和我约会，好吗？\n因为我也要饰演一个爱上志保的人嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1035_033sih", "source_sha256": "a59768304e318d04e6cc1264f420e27bd69047716d8795da7e8b9fcc2b2cebfb", "ja": "デートって……今さら必要ないでしょう。\n通し稽古まで終わってるのに。", "zh": "约会……事到如今就没必要了吧。\n连完整排练都结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1036_052kao", "source_sha256": "145a3c05b34947ce5dd589325caf3580a64149fb20005ee6681aa3d9bc1570d5", "ja": "ええ～？　そんなこと言わずに、デートしましょう？\nね、志保ちゃん。お願い！", "zh": "诶～？别这么说嘛，我们去约会吧？好不好，志保。拜托啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1037_033sih", "source_sha256": "137cddaaaa184bef2405d7f3b4dc2f914f35fcf4f951d28159ca396783b76277", "ja": "もう……仕方ありませんね。\n歌織さんにはお世話になりましたし、少しだけなら。", "zh": "真拿您没办法……\n我也受了歌织小姐很多照顾，稍微陪您一下的话倒是可以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1038_052kao", "source_sha256": "65abee41ee2c9b11c1f66aa7bb8dae0b8bce26ed29bd5dabe0a1ba081580a198", "ja": "やった♪　ありがとう、志保ちゃん。ふふっ！", "zh": "太好了♪谢谢你，志保。呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1039_052kao", "source_sha256": "8742a4f6726be4dd61d452a212de93ff5f21725bc6af7f5249166b2b148bfb8a", "ja": "やっぱり、デートと言えばドライブよね。\nどこに行こうかしら……わくわくしてきちゃった♪", "zh": "果然，说到约会就是兜风嘛。\n要去哪里好呢……真让人兴奋起来了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1040_033sih", "source_sha256": "4d31aff916e26bf25c4c1c2f0c6ea6d8cd8f4dd4cddd3d3f164b1511daa0df19", "ja": "あ、あの……歌織さん？\n本当に、役作りのためってわかってますか？", "zh": "啊、那个……歌织小姐？\n您真的明白这是为了塑造角色吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1041_052kao", "source_sha256": "bbbaf56a75043e5bd8fc7c629ed9f4d9a7af85e37229e5efd47df140112e66fa", "ja": "もちろん！　心配しないで。こんなこともあろうかと、\nイケメンらしい振る舞い方を習ってきたから♪", "zh": "当然！别担心。我早就料到可能会有这种情况，\n已经去学过帅哥该有的举止了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1042_021mat", "source_sha256": "c43665190f978e2114e6ea53f3f91d51eef06712379b7262488893bccccea4bb", "ja": "ほ？　歌織ちゃん、その情報は初耳なのです。\n姫にも、詳しく聞かせてほしいのです。", "zh": "哦？歌织，这消息姬还是第一次听说呢。也请详细说给姬听听吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1043_017kth", "source_sha256": "fc2468dea4dcee96c9355b3d8f4752b0593b024388ef6dedd3fdf47643cce21a", "ja": "イケメンらしい振る舞い方……？\nあの、歌織さん。いったい誰に習ったんですか？", "zh": "像帅哥一样的举止……？\n那个，歌织小姐。你到底是跟谁学的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1044_052kao", "source_sha256": "cfd9258dfcdaea1e31d57bd6d571a19c55cc775aca29bbde3ba223ffb6101dae", "ja": "それは……内緒♪", "zh": "这个嘛……保密♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1045_021mat", "source_sha256": "3e6aa4fb6a5a9bcea8f679b1ac45aa4625e7884937be3fbbbbccb2cad5faa663", "ja": "ほ！？", "zh": "哦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1046_017kth", "source_sha256": "a05521fc9807db23d271b9b94aa1ef06e276f69e4d25a574e04a065598991b18", "ja": "歌織さん……ずるいです！", "zh": "歌织姐……太狡猾了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1047_052kao", "source_sha256": "3d2ed4eeaf57aebaa7c2834aa84f33d5f2fc6e34cb1227257fb9c08390b906ea", "ja": "ごめんなさい。だって、ふたりともお芝居がすごいから\n……こうでもしないと負けちゃいそうで。ふふっ！", "zh": "对不起。因为你们两个人的演技都太厉害了……不这样做的话，我好像就要输了。呵呵！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1048_052kao", "source_sha256": "b89fe3ea1a3e4b6d61f7d3e0894ee307202d10acec7b51145e62e5ce9b5d4e29", "ja": "とにかく、志保ちゃんのことは私がちゃんと\nエスコートしてみせるから！　期待しててね♪", "zh": "总之，志保就交给我来好好护送吧！期待一下哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1049_033sih", "source_sha256": "dffc6e10b3bbd3a9b02d6ef2913af702050c4be7907e357650f0a0c354d707c7", "ja": "は、はあ……。", "zh": "这、这样啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1050_p", "source_sha256": "38a108e6868cded6957be33803717a155c2162abe33a7cb72575344691e67b00", "ja": "（志保も歌織さんも、そしてまつりも琴葉も。\n皆、お互いに影響を与え合う事で成長している……）", "zh": "（志保、歌织小姐，还有小满、琴叶。大家都在相互影响中不断成长……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0144_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0144_story_06_1051_p", "source_sha256": "e689aa578d3c07f7ca6638a28e40b626c11d1cd4bdda213065e8183effe3d4f9", "ja": "（4人のミュージカル……いよいよ、開幕だな！）", "zh": "（4人的音乐剧……终于要开幕了啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
